.TH std::ctype_byname 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::ctype_byname \- std::ctype_byname

.SH Synopsis
Defined in header <locale>
template< class CharT >
class ctype_byname : public std::ctype<CharT>;

std::ctype_byname is a std::ctype facet which encapsulates character classification rules
of the locale specified at its construction.

.SH Specializations

The standard library is guaranteed to provide the following specializations:

Defined in header <locale>
std::ctype_byname<char>    provides narrow character classification (uses table lookup for
                           character classification)
std::ctype_byname<wchar_t> provides wide character classification

