std::ctype_byname::ctype_byname

explicit ctype_byname( const char* name, std::size_t refs = 0 );
explicit ctype_byname( const std::string& name, std::size_t refs = 0 );  \fI(since C++11)\fP

Constructs a new std::ctype_byname facet for a locale with name.

refs is used for resource management: if refs == 0, the implementation destroys the facet,
when the last std::locale object holding it is destroyed. Otherwise, the object is not
destroyed.

.SH Parameters

name - the name of the locale
refs - the number of references that link to the facet

